eft + \",\" + hlg.padding.right + \" ctrlW=\" + hlg.childControlWidth + \" expW=\" + hlg.childForceExpandWidth);\n        for (int c = 0; c < go.transform.childCount; c++) {\n            var ch = go.transform.GetChild(c) as UnityEngine.RectTransform;\n            if (ch != null)\n                sb.AppendLine(\"    [\" + c + \"] \" + ch.name + \" act=\" + ch.gameObject.activeSelf + \" aPos=\" + ch.anchoredPosition + \" size=\" + ch.sizeDelta);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// C. Terrain Chunks & Crease / Border Diagnostics\nvar flags = System.Reflection.BindingFlags.Instance | System.Reflection.BindingFlags.NonPublic | System.Reflection.BindingFlags.Public;\nvar tpField = typeof(MapGrid).GetField(\"terrainProvider\", flags);\nvar scField = typeof(IslandTerrainProvider).GetField(\"sampleCache\", flags);\nvar settingsField = typeof(IslandTerrainProvider).GetField(\"settings\", flags);\n\nvar grids = UnityEngine.Resources.FindObjectsOfTypeAll<MapGrid>();\nsb.AppendLine(\"=== MapGrids (\" + grids.Length + \") ===\");\nfor (int g = 0; g < grids.Length; g++) {\n    var grid = grids[g];\n    if (UnityEditor.EditorUtility.IsPersistent(grid.gameObject)) continue;\n    var mf = grid.GetComponent<UnityEngine.MeshFilter>();\n    var mesh = mf != null ? mf.sharedMesh : null;\n    if (mesh == null) continue;\n    var verts = mesh.vertices;\n    var norms = mesh.normals;\n    int side = UnityEngine.Mathf.RoundToInt(UnityEngine.Mathf.Sqrt(verts.Length));\n    float maxY = float.MinValue, minY = float.MaxValue, maxBorderY = float.MinValue;\n    int borderAboveWater = 0;\n    for (int z = 0; z < side; z++) {\n        for (int x = 0; x < side; x++) {\n            float y = verts[z * side + x].y;\n            if (y > maxY) maxY = y;\n            if (y < minY) minY = y;\n            if (x == 0 || z == 0 || x == side - 1 || z == side - 1) {\n                if (y > maxBorderY) maxBorderY = y;\n                if (y > -0.5f) borderAboveWater++;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    if (maxBorderY > -0.5f || grid.gameObject.name == \"Island 31\" || grid.gameObject.name == \"Island 19\" || grid.gameObject.name == \"Plateau 45\") {\n        sb.AppendLine(\"  \" + grid.gameObject.name + \" (\" + grid.currentGridType + \") wPos=\" + grid.transform.position\n            + \" side=\" + side + \" vBounds=(\" + verts[0].x.ToString(\"F1\") + \"..\" + verts[verts.Length-1].x.ToString(\"F1\") + \")\"\n            + \" y=[\" + minY.ToString(\"F2\") + \"..\" + maxY.ToString(\"F2\") + \"] maxBorderY=\" + maxBorderY.ToString(\"F2\") + \" border>water=\" + borderAboveWater);\n    }\n\n    if (grid.gameObject.name == \"Island 31\" || grid.gameObject.name == \"Island 19\" || grid.gameObject.name == \"Plateau 45\") {\n        var tp = tpField != null ? tpField.GetValue(grid) as IslandTerrainProvider : null;\n        if (tp != null && settingsField != null) {\n            var sObj = settingsField.GetValue(tp);\n            if (sObj != null) {\n                var rF = sObj.GetType().GetField(\"islandRadius\");\n                var fF = sObj.GetType().GetField(\"falloffSharpness\");\n                var wrF = sObj.GetType().GetField(\"waterHeight\");\n                sb.AppendLine(\"    settings: radius=\" + (rF != null ? rF.GetValue(sObj) : \"?\") + \" falloff=\" + (fF != null ? fF.GetValue(sObj) : \"?\") + \" water=\" + (wrF != null ? wrF.GetValue(sObj) : \"?\"));\n            }\n        }\n        // Inspect flatland creases (0.2 < y < 1.3)\n        int creaseCount = 0;\n        float worstDrop = 0f;\n        int worstIdx = -1;\n        for (int z = 1; z < side - 1; z++) {\n            for (int x = 1; x < side - 1; x++) {\n                int idx = z * side + x;\n                float y = verts[idx].y;\n                if (y < 0.2f || y > 1.3f) continue;\n                float nMin = UnityEngine.Mathf.Min(UnityEngine.Mathf.Min(verts[idx-1].y, verts[idx+1].y), UnityEngine.Mathf.Min(verts[idx-side].y, verts[idx+side].y));\n                float nMax = UnityEngine.Mathf.Max(UnityEngine.Mathf.Max(verts[idx-1].y, verts[idx+1].y), UnityEngine.Mathf.Max(verts[idx-side].y, verts[idx+side].y));\n                float avgN = 0.25f * (verts[idx-1].y + verts[idx+1].y + verts[idx-side].y + verts[idx+side].y);\n                if (UnityEngine.Mathf.Abs(avgN - y) > 0.04f || norms[idx].y < 0.85f) {\n                    creaseCount++;\n                    float span = nMax - nMin;\n                    if (span > worstDrop) { worstDrop = span; worstIdx = idx; }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        sb.AppendLine(\"    flatland creases (0.2<y<1.3): count=\" + creaseCount + \" worstSpan=\" + worstDrop.ToString(\"F3\"));\n        if (worstIdx >= 0) {\n            int wx = worstIdx % side;\n            int wz = worstIdx / side;\n            sb.AppendLine(\"    worst @ (\" + wx + \",\" + wz + \") lPos=\" + verts[worstIdx] + \" norm=\" + norms[worstIdx]\n                + \" yN=[L:\" + verts[worstIdx-1].y.ToString(\"F3\") + \",R:\" + verts[worstIdx+1].y.ToString(\"F3\") + \",D:\" + verts[worstIdx-side].y.ToString(\"F3\") + \",U:\" + verts[worstIdx+side].y.ToString(\"F3\") + \"]\");\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nreturn sb.ToString();\n","safety_checks":true,"compiler":"codedom"}}
